  "notes": "KRBL Limited (NSE: KRBL) \u2014 world's largest basmati rice miller and exporter, owner of the India Gate brand (also Nur Jahan, Doon, Unity). ~195 TPH milling capacity at Dhuri (Punjab) and Ghaziabad (UP); paddy procurement primarily from Punjab/Haryana. ~80%+ revenue from basmati (split ~40-45% domestic / 35-40% exports \u2014 Middle East, US, EU, UK). Indian fiscal year ends March 31. All values in INR millions (1 INR crore = INR 10 million). Source: annual reports filed with BSE/NSE, investor presentations on krblrice.com. Heavy paddy inventory (24+ months ageing for premium basmati) drives working-capital intensity but supports strong gross margins. Cash-rich balance sheet (limited net debt \u2014 typically modest working capital lines only). Sector: Agribusiness / Trader. ED/SEBI regulatory overhang in 2018 was resolved; consistent cash-generative business. Figures rounded.",
